  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amplify-Invest-Reach Partnership: DFAT support to Women&apos;s Funds (Indo-Pacific) 2021 - 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia supports women&#x2019;s rights organisations and human rights defenders across the Indo-Pacific region.  The four-year Amplify &#x2013; Invest &#x2013; Reach (A-I-R) works through four key regional partners: Women&apos;s Fund Asia, Urgent Action Fund Asia &amp; Pacific, Pacific Feminist Fund,	Women&apos;s Fund Fiji. These funds work with and provide financial support to grassroots women&#x2019;s rights organisations and human rights defenders.  
This partnership promotes human rights outcomes and contributes to sustainable change towards gender equality through three end of program outcomes:

1. Amplify &#x2013; build and connect movements to support social change;

2. Invest &#x2013; grow and sustain organisations that address marginalisation and exclusion; 

3. Reach &#x2013; Women&#x2019;s Funds provide grants to women&#x2019;s rights organisations and human rights defenders to lead the social change agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
